<p class="bl-note">The first tag on each card repeats the summary the app shows for that topic in its Library &amp; classroom list (with sound on). For the four topics with letter tracing, the app adds “· includes letter tracing” to the same line; the cards show it as a separate “Includes letter tracing” tag. Tags describe a <span class="bl-ui">5 new items + practice</span> session; a <span class="bl-ui">5 new items only</span> session has no practice. “Fewer practice activities with sound off” marks topics where turning sound off leaves out some practice.</p>
<p class="bl-note">In version 1.1.2 and later, practice is chosen again on every visit, so a child who comes back meets different practice. Each practice in a session is a different kind of activity, mixing listening and on-screen ones when sound is on. Topics with letter tracing always include it, and a <span class="bl-ui">Skip tracing</span> button lets a child move on without tracing. In earlier versions, tracing moves on only after a trace, so trace together or end the session if it does not suit the child.</p>
<p class="bl-note">Topic content is the same from version 1.1.0 through 1.1.2 and is shown with the app's English guidance.</p>
